    MC "(왠지 그 여자는 {i}확실히{/i} 골칫거리일 것 같아.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:463
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_26f64471:

    # MC "(Why did she have to be so damn... {i}alluring{/i} though?)"
    MC "(근데 왜 그렇게 지독하게... {i}매혹적{/i}이어야 했던 거야?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:465
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2172bda8:

    # "Deciding it wasn't worth risking getting in trouble over, I simply carried on with my duties before heading back towards the barracks, exhausted and in desperate need of sleep."
    "문제를 일으킬 위험을 감수할 가치가 없다고 판단하고, 나는 그저 내 임무를 계속 수행한 뒤, 지치고 잠이 절실한 채로 병영으로 돌아갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:480
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0NightEvent_7f67c5b5:

    # "Days over days of intense, all-round training consumed us."
    "며칠, 또 며칠의 강도 높은 전방위 훈련이 우리를 집어삼켰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:481
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0NightEvent_23189b31:

    # "We had to be up very early every day and stayed out in the yard until the sunset, the sounds of sword fighting following us into our dreams."
    "우리는 매일 아주 일찍 일어나야 했고, 해가 질 때까지 훈련장에 머물렀다. 검술 소리는 꿈속까지 따라왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:482
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0NightEvent_fb0b868b:

    # "Captain Duprey enforced a rigorous routine: every day began with us making our beds and ensuring that the living conditions were immaculate."
    "뒤프레 대위는 엄격한 일과를 강요했다: 매일 아침 침상 정리와 생활 공간을 완벽하게 유지하는 것으로 시작되었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:483
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0NightEvent_ecf68a7d:

    # "I have noticed a subtle, ongoing change in how we reacted to the disciplinary nightmare around us:"
    "나는 우리 주변의 규율이라는 악몽에 우리가 어떻게 반응하는지 미묘하고도 지속적인 변화를 알아챘다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:484
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0NightEvent_dfab6f70:

    # "The tasks we normally found annoying and handled with haste or carelessness now became more and more of a mindless, automatic sequences of actions for us."
    "평소에는 귀찮아하며 대충대충 서두르던 임무들이, 이제는 점점 더 아무 생각 없이 자동적으로 수행되는 일련의 동작들이 되어가고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:485
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0NightEvent_dbb42f29:

    # "There was a certain weird appeal to it, which left me wondering..."
    "그것에는 묘한 매력이 있었고, 나는 궁금증을 떨칠 수 없었다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:486
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training0NightEvent_683c4015:

    # "Just how much {i}change{/i} will I go through, being a part of the Scouts Corp?"
    "정찰대의 일원이 됨으로써, 나는 얼마나 많은 {i}변화{/i}를 겪게 될 것인가?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:502
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_0dff416c:

    # DUPREY "How many strikes are needed to end a fight?"
    DUPREY "전투를 끝내려면 몇 번의 공격이 필요하냐?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:503
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_676c207b:

    # "There were murmurs amongst the recruits as random answers were thrown out."
    "신병들 사이에서 웅성거림이 일고 무작위 답변이 튀어나왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:505
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_193edec0:

    # RECRUITS "{i}As many as it takes!{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}필요한 만큼이요!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:506
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_6321b742:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Lots?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}많이요?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:507
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_ca66605c:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Uhh, depends where you hit?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}어... 때리는 부위에 따라 다른 거 아니에요?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:508
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_337684ae:

    # DUPREY "{i}One.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}한 번.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:509
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_bcc6d0d1:

    # DUPREY "One is sufficient."
    DUPREY "한 번이면 충분하다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:510
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_4e4f4269:

    # DUPREY "Do not over exert yourself wasting time when one blow will suffice."
    DUPREY "한 번의 일격으로 충분할 때 시간 낭비하며 과도하게 힘을 쓰지 마라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:511
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_618fb113:

    # DUPREY "...Today, we're going to be practicing a special attack."
    DUPREY "...오늘은 특수 공격을 연습할 거다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:512
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_8a04845f:

    # DUPREY "The more 'special' the move, the more {i}energy{/i} you waste."
    DUPREY "기술이 '특별'할수록, 더 많은 {i}에너지{/i}를 낭비하게 된다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:513
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_f2b635e0:

    # DUPREY "Becoming too tired in a battle is a death sentence, keep this in mind..."
    DUPREY "전투에서 너무 지치는 것은 사형 선고나 다름없다. 이걸 명심해라..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:514
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_9d60ce81:

    # DUPREY "Knowing how and {i}when{/i} to use special moves like these can be the difference between life and death."
    DUPREY "이런 특수 기술을 어떻게, 그리고 {i}언제{/i} 사용해야 하는지 아는 것이 삶과 죽음을 가를 수 있다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:515
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_5681d705:

    # DUPREY "Besides that, our weapons, armor and skills are not our {i}only{/i} tools."
    DUPREY "게다가, 우리의 무기와 갑옷, 기술만이 우리의 {i}유일한{/i} 도구는 아니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:516
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_ebd0b574:

    # DUPREY "Elixirs, poisons, kick fucking sand in their eyes for all I care."
    DUPREY "엘릭서, 독약, 심지어 씨발 모래를 눈에 뿌려도 상관없다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:517
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_33cac016:

    # DUPREY "The point is, you will each be expected to carry some basic supplies with you such as health vials."
    DUPREY "핵심은, 너희 모두가 회복 물약 같은 기본 보급품을 휴대해야 한다는 거다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:518
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_dba0fa03:

    # DUPREY "I cannot count the amount of times I've seen men bought back from the edge of death thanks to these beauties."
    DUPREY "이 예쁜 것들 덕분에 죽음의 문턱에서 살아 돌아온 남자들을 내가 얼마나 많이 봤는지 셀 수도 없다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:519
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_a34b076d:

    # "Captain Duprey dangled one of the elixirs in his hand."
    "뒤프레 대위는 손에 든 엘릭서 하나를 달랑거렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:520
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_2f96e2f3:

    # DUPREY "Each of you will now spar, and upon injuring the other, use one of these."
    DUPREY "이제 각자 대련을 하고, 상대방에게 부상을 입히면 이걸 사용해라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:522
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_1b8bd188:

    # "Quartermaster Joakim moved down the line, handing each of us a small elixir."
    "병참장교 요아킴이 줄을 따라 내려오며 우리 각자에게 작은 엘릭서를 건넸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:526
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_dc140759:

    # JOAKIM @ talk "Don't use it all at once, greenhorns!"
    JOAKIM @ talk "한 번에 다 쓰지 마라, 풋내기들!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:528
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_fc8dd38d:

    # "Joakim laughed to himself as he retreated off to the sides, folding his arms and smiling as he waited for the spectacle to begin."
    "요아킴은 혼자 웃으며 옆으로 물러나, 팔짱을 끼고 미소 지으며 구경거리가 시작되길 기다렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:529
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_56e81d35:

    # DUPREY "Now, partner up for sparring."
    DUPREY "자, 대련할 짝을 지어라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:530
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...시작!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:555
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1414ae63:

    # MARKUS "*Huff* *Huff* You sure have got some {i}special moves{/i}, [player_name!t]."
    MARKUS "*헉* *헉* 너 참 {i}특별한 기술{/i}들을 가지고 있구나, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:556
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d58a2ad6:

    # "After Markus caught his breath, he asked:"
    "마르쿠스가 숨을 고르고 나서 물었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:557
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_7ade564e:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Care to give me another chance?"
    MARKUS @ smile "나한테 한 번 더 기회를 줄래?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:559
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d34ca5ec:

    # MARKUS "Come on, [player_name!t]."
    MARKUS "어서, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:560
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1a96582f:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Where's your mojo? Your battle-jive?"
    MARKUS @ smile "네 그 열정은 어디 갔어? 전투의 리듬은?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:561
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_89a8d71d:

    # MC "My... *Huff* *Huff* ...What?"
    MC "내... *헉* *헉* ...뭐라고?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:562
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1215579d:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again, I felt as if I was swinging it against a training dummy!"
    MARKUS "다시 한 번 하자, 방금은 연습용 허수아비한테 휘두르는 것 같았어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:566
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_96a358be:

    # MARKUS "That's better now!"
    MARKUS "이제 좀 낫군!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:567
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_dbbfb15d:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Remember, 'special moves like these can be the difference between life and death'!"
    MARKUS @ smile "기억해, '이런 특수 기술이 삶과 죽음을 가를 수 있다'잖아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:568
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1d019d6b:

    # "Markus smiled as he perfectly quoted Duprey."
    "마르쿠스가 뒤프레의 말을 완벽하게 인용하며 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:569
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_4baaa790:

    # MC "Okay, I'll kick your ass now, {i}captain{/i}."
    MC "좋아, 이제 네 엉덩이를 차주마, {i}대위님{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:570
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_397f9c31:

    # MARKUS "On guard!"
    MARKUS "받아라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:575
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "그래, 좋아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:576
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_40b12a4d:

    # MARKUS "It was kinda cool though, wasn't it?"
    MARKUS "그래도 꽤 멋졌잖아, 그렇지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:577
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_eb54f1a5:

    # MC "Yeah, beats swinging it against these training dummies!"
    MC "그래, 이 연습용 허수아비들한테 휘두르는 것보단 훨씬 낫네!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:585
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ba3a1381:

    # "For the remainder of the day, Duprey educated us on the nuances of using various special skills, tools and items in battle."
    "남은 하루 동안, 뒤프레는 전투에서 다양한 특수 기술, 도구, 그리고 아이템을 사용하는 뉘앙스에 대해 우리를 교육했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:586
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d61d0b14:

    # "Exhausted, I didn't really get much of it: magic refraction scrolls, ensnarement crystals, Vulshan smoke bombs..."
    "지친 나머지 나는 제대로 듣지도 못했다: 마법 굴절 두루마리, 속박 수정, 불샨 연막탄..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:587
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_3a645881:

    # "Come dusk, Duprey concluded with showing us some advanced combat moves, I guess to somehow inspire us to master the art of combat."
    "해질녘이 되자, 뒤프레는 아마도 우리에게 검술을 익히도록 영감을 주려는 듯 고급 전투 동작들을 보여주며 마무리했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:592
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ca79f8f3:

    # DUPREY "...So this is how you do the Waltzing Bazark strike."
    DUPREY "...자, 이게 발칭 바자크 공격법이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:593
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_7f316660:

    # "Duprey caught his breath after executing a rather spectacular combat move."
    "꽤나 화려한 전투 동작을 선보인 뒤, 뒤프레는 숨을 골랐다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:594
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_55a1cf16:

    # "He scanned the crowd of recruits, totally exhausted from another training session, and I can promise I saw a hint of fatherly smile on his face."
    "그는 또 한 번의 훈련에 완전히 지친 신병 무리를 훑어보았고, 나는 그의 얼굴에서 아버지 같은 미소의 흔적을 분명히 보았다고 장담할 수 있다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:595
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_56df01de:

    # DUPREY "Okay, you lot."
    DUPREY "좋아, 이것들아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:596
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_60e9fa7e:

    # DUPREY "Go and take some rest now."
    DUPREY "이제 가서 좀 쉬어라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:602
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_c70200c9:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other in confusion:"
    "나와 마르쿠스는 혼란스러운 표정으로 서로를 바라보았다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:603
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_b1a7928d:

    # MC "A Waltzing Bazark? I'm not even trying something like that."
    MC "발칭 바자크? 난 그런 건 시도조차 안 할 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:604
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_99873a35:

    # MARKUS "You'd be collecting me from all over the yard if I did..."
    MARKUS "내가 만약 그랬다면 넌 훈련장 여기저기서 내 조각들을 주워 모으고 있었을걸..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:647
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a3accbf:

    # REGINA "...[player_name!t]."
    REGINA "...[player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:648
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_7199e905:

    # REGINA "Wake up, [player_name!t]."
    REGINA "일어나, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:652
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a66cc92:

    # "As my eyes slowly peeled open, a dark, raven haired blob was stood, lurched over the side of my bed."
    "눈이 천천히 떠지자, 검은 까마귀 같은 머리칼의 형체가 내 침상 옆에 구부정하게 서 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:653
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_c40f7ba2:

    # "My vision became clearer: there I saw, clear as day, [regina_ref!t] crouched over and smiling towards me."
    "시야가 점점 선명해졌다: 바로 거기에, 대낮처럼 또렷하게, [regina_ref!t]이(가) 내 쪽을 향해 웅크리고 앉아 미소 짓고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:654
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_0bbec91f:

    # MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"
    MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:655
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3fe750ff:

    # "[regina_ref_cap!t] placed her finger over her lip and motioned for me to be silent."
    "[regina_ref_cap!t]이(가) 손가락을 입술에 대고 조용히 하라고 손짓했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:656
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_87f8b481:

    # "{i}Was this some kind of a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}이게 무슨 꿈인가?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:657
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_9ce974a4:

    # "She leaned in close to whisper."
    "그녀가 속삭이려고 가까이 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:658
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_32cf642b:

    # REGINA @ smile "I've bought you some things, dear."
    REGINA @ smile "네게 몇 가지 가져왔단다, 얘야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:659
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_6f52509f:

    # REGINA @ talk "{i}Just a little something between the two of us...{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "{i}우리 둘만의 작은 비밀이란다...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:660
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caa43851:

    # MC @ surprised "How ... How did you even get in here?"
    MC @ surprised "어떻게... 여긴 어떻게 들어온 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:661
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_257c75a7:

    # REGINA @ talk "Don't worry about that now, dear."
    REGINA @ talk "그건 지금 걱정하지 말거라, 얘야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:662
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_eb2e578c:

    # REGINA @ talk "I just wanted to see you."
    REGINA @ talk "그냥 네 얼굴이 보고 싶었단다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:663
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_fb531ee6:

    # MC @ talk "But-"
    MC @ talk "하지만—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:664
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24a60a73:

    # "As her hand gently caressed my cheek, I began to feel myself drifting back to the darkness once again."
    "그녀의 손이 부드럽게 내 뺨을 어루만지자, 나는 다시 어둠 속으로 빠져드는 것을 느꼈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:666
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4ff52e4f:

    # "{i}Perhaps, this really was a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}어쩌면, 이건 정말 꿈이었을까?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:667
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_ccaef93c:

    # REGINA @ talk "Shhh... {i}Sleep, dear.{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "쉿... {i}자거라, 얘야.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:668
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_898758b8:

    # REGINA "{i}I'll always be here for you...{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}난 항상 네 곁에 있을 거란다...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:669
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3b1abd21:

    # REGINA "{i}...no matter what.{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}...무슨 일이 있어도.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:693
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caba15b5:

    # "Springing upright in my bed, soaked in sweat, I looked around as people prepared themselves for another day of training."
    "땀에 흠뻑 젖은 채 침상에서 벌떡 일어나 주위를 둘러보니, 사람들은 또 하루의 훈련을 준비하고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:696
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4f0b95e9:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]? Are you alright?"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]? 괜찮아?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:697
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24f0136a:

    # MC @ scared "I ... I think so."
    MC @ scared "나... 괜찮은 것 같아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:698
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_328b83d2:

    # MARKUS "Bad dreams?"
    MARKUS "악몽 꿨어?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:700
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_b260c7ad:

    # MC @ scared "...I'm not sure what it was."
    MC @ scared "...뭔지 잘 모르겠어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:701
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5d45ce3:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Well, you look like you've seen a ghost!"
    MARKUS @ shock "야, 너 유령이라도 본 것 같아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:702
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5193f8a:

    # "Somehow, a ghost felt more explainable than what I saw last night..."
    "어쩐지, 유령이 어젯밤 내가 본 것보다 더 설명하기 쉬울 것 같았다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:703
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_247c26f4:

    # MARKUS "Come, I'm sure a few whacks from a training sword will take your mind off whatever it was!"
    MARKUS "가자, 훈련용 검으로 몇 대 맞으면 뭐였든 신경 안 쓰이게 될 거야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:706
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_a8954217:

    # "As Markus headed out of the barracks towards the training yard, I shook my head, pushing the strange dream aside."
    "마르쿠스가 병영을 나서 훈련장으로 향하자, 나는 고개를 저으며 그 이상한 꿈을 밀쳐냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:708
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_83da7088:

    # "Opening my chest to grab my uniform, I noticed immediately the strangely placed bottle of red wine that wasn't there before..."
    "제복을 꺼내려고 상자를 열자, 전에는 없었던 이상하게 놓인 적포도주 한 병이 바로 눈에 띄었다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:710
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_01b21009:

    # MC @ scared "(It... It was a dream!)"
    MC @ scared "(그... 그건 꿈이었어!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:713
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d62002c2:

    # MC @ think "(...Right?)"
    MC @ think "(...그렇지?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:725
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f1834407:

    # DUPREY "...So, having being around a little, what do you lot think matters the most in battle?"
    DUPREY "...그래서, 좀 지내봤으니, 전투에서 가장 중요한 게 뭐라고 생각하나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:726
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_84edc41c:

    # "We looked at each other puzzled."
    "우리는 당황하며 서로를 바라보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:728
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_cef8185e:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Strength?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}힘이요?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:729
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6cf01769:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Our gear!{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}우리 장비요!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:730
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_5b70b478:

    # "Some of us were throwing more words out there, until..."
    "몇몇이 더 많은 말을 던지고 있던 중, 마침내..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:731
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_59efef91:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Being like... a single force?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}하나의... 단일한 전력이 되는 것?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:732
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_60c375e0:

    # "I swear I saw a hint of suprise on Duprey's face:"
    "나는 분명 뒤프레의 얼굴에 놀라움이 스치는 것을 보았다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:733
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_a52d9426:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Right on, lad!"
    DUPREY @ laugh "바로 그거다, 젊은이!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:734
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ae81de48:

    # "Silence covered our ranks, as we have began to realize what today's lesson was about."
    "침묵이 우리 대열을 뒤덮었다. 우리는 오늘의 교훈이 무엇에 관한 것인지 깨닫기 시작했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:735
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_c6bbed4f:

    # "Duprey smiled for a moment as he continued:"
    "뒤프레가 잠시 미소 지으며 말을 이었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:736
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f6068bdd:

    # DUPREY "Teamwork, lads."
    DUPREY "팀워크다, 젊은이들."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:737
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2c171579:

    # DUPREY "Confidence in a soldier to your left and a soldier to your right, {i}this{/i} is the driving force behind any worthy army."
    DUPREY "네 왼쪽의 병사와 네 오른쪽의 병사에 대한 신뢰, {i}이것이{/i} 바로 모든 가치 있는 군대의 원동력이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:738
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_479fffc2:

    # "Duprey began pointing at recruits from the crowd:"
    "뒤프레가 군중 속 신병들을 가리키기 시작했다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:739
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_54599814:

    # DUPREY "You can have the best gear in all Alderay!"
    DUPREY "너는 알데레이 전체에서 가장 좋은 장비를 가질 수 있다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:740
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fae39187:

    # DUPREY "And you can be an expert at handling your weapon of choice,"
    DUPREY "그리고 너는 네가 선택한 무기를 다루는 전문가가 될 수 있고,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:741
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_812a5810:

    # DUPREY "While your bag of dirty tricks can grow as large as to become a caravan,"
    DUPREY "네 비열한 속임수 주머니는 마차 하나만큼이나 커질 수 있지만,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:742
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_671d40a2:

    # "Some recruits laughed as Duprey continued, ever more serious:"
    "뒤프레가 더욱 진지하게 말을 이어가자, 일부 신병들이 웃었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:743
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2ff1717a:

    # DUPREY "But if you don't have a warrior, a true battle brother you are dead sure in at your side,"
    DUPREY "하지만 네 곁에, 진정한 전우, 진짜 전투 형제가 없다면,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:744
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ff502967:

    # DUPREY "One who would stand with you no matter what is coming at you..."
    DUPREY "무슨 일이 닥쳐도 너와 함께 버텨줄 존재가 없다면..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:745
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_95d64e38:

    # "Duprey's expression turned pale for a moment, as if his mind's eye erupted with memories."
    "뒤프레의 표정이 잠시 창백해졌다, 마치 마음의 눈에 기억들이 폭발하듯 떠오르는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:746
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fa17f4b8:

    # DUPREY "You {i}will be{/i} obliterated."
    DUPREY "너는 {i}반드시{/i} 전멸당할 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:747
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_828b281f:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other and nodded stoically, but Duprey's usual commanding tone snapped us out of it quick:"
    "나와 마르쿠스는 서로를 바라보며 굳게 고개를 끄덕였지만, 뒤프레의 평소 명령조가 우리를 빠르게 정신 차리게 했다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:748
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_b5b6ec4e:

    # DUPREY "None of us would want that to happen, right you maggots?!"
    DUPREY "그 누구도 그런 일이 일어나길 바라지 않겠지, 이 구더기 놈들아?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:750
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_41a3cf71:

    # DUPREY "Today, you will spar in teams of two!"
    DUPREY "오늘은 2인 1조로 대련한다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:751
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_dfb15ac9:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, and get to it!"
    DUPREY "짝을 짓고, 시작해라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:752
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...시작!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:776
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_22336bc1:

    # MARKUS "Phew... You guys kicked our ass!"
    MARKUS "휴... 너희들 우리 엉덩이를 완전히 찼어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:777
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d5403c39:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again now!"
    MARKUS "자, 다시 한 번 가자!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:778
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d4066694:

    # MARKUS "I swear you won't get us this time!"
    MARKUS "맹세컨대 이번엔 우리한테 안 당할걸!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:780
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4303ca27:

    # "Markus and his teammate both looked at us two."
    "마르쿠스와 그의 팀원 둘 다 우리 둘을 바라보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:781
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4c68b6fe:

    # MARKUS "Come on guys, remember what Duprey said!"
    MARKUS "어서, 얘들아, 뒤프레가 뭐라 했는지 기억나지!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:782
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_072ed379:

    # MARKUS "Be a single force!"
    MARKUS "하나의 전력이 되라고!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:783
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_7e6c58ca:

    # "His teammate interrupted:"
    "그의 팀원이 끼어들었다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:785
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_c87c6273:

    # RECRUIT "Actually... it was me who said it..."
    RECRUIT "사실... 그 말 한 건 저인데요..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:786
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_76d4b651:

    # "I let out a laugh which echoed painfully all over my body."
    "나는 웃음을 터뜨렸고, 그 웃음은 내 온몸에 고통스럽게 울려 퍼졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:787
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_33a51547:

    # MARKUS "... Whatever! Come on, let's go for another round!"
    MARKUS "...뭐 어쨌든! 자, 한 판 더 하자!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:790
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_2af51c90:

    # MARKUS "That's what I like to hear!"
    MARKUS "그거야 내가 듣고 싶던 말이지!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:791
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_102beb74:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Let's see if our 'army' defeats yours this time!"
    MARKUS @ smile "이번엔 우리 '군대'가 너희를 이기는지 두고 보자!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:795
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "그래, 좋아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:796
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1506ca74:

    # MARKUS "I've sprained my ankle anyways..."
    MARKUS "어차피 발목도 삐었고..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:799
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_3c091867:

    # "The rest of the day we have spent learning more nuances about working together as a combat unit."
    "남은 하루 우리는 전투 유닛으로 함께 일하는 것에 대한 더 많은 뉘앙스를 배우며 보냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:800
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1da7d2b2:

    # "As we have come to realize the importance of teamwork in practice, Duprey's initial statement of it being the crucial aspect of warfare became clear as day."
    "팀워크의 중요성을 실전에서 깨닫게 되면서, 그것이 전쟁의 핵심 요소라는 뒤프레의 초기 발언은 대낮처럼 명확해졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:801
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_73c0dac8:

    # "We had to {i}become{/i} the Second Scouts Division."
    "우리는 제2정찰대 사단으로 {i}거듭나야만{/i} 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:806
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5d262372:

    # DUPREY "...So, that will be it for today, Scouts."
    DUPREY "...자, 오늘은 여기까지다, 정찰대."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:807
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_b8c44b07:

    # DUPREY "And one more thing..."
    DUPREY "그리고 한 가지 더..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:808
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_f2c412ef:

    # DUPREY "We can't be training in this cage forever,"
    DUPREY "우리가 이 우리 안에서 영원히 훈련만 할 순 없지,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:809
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_fc3f4089:

    # "Duprey waved at the walls,"
    "뒤프레가 성벽을 향해 손을 흔들며,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:810
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5bc59c1b:

    # DUPREY "But before we begin any real training maneuvers, I need to see just how much you lot had learned since you've got here."
    DUPREY "하지만 본격적인 훈련 기동을 시작하기 전에, 너희가 여기 온 이후로 얼마나 배웠는지 확인해야겠다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:811
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_37c4720a:

    # DUPREY "Hit that bunk hard for there will be a test tomorrow!"
    DUPREY "침상에 머릴 처박아라, 내일 시험이 있을 테니!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:812
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "이상!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:817
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_70c270b5:

    # "Me and Markus exchanged looks."
    "나와 마르쿠스는 시선을 교환했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:818
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5dbd6a38:

    # MARKUS "A test, huh?"
    MARKUS "시험이라, 응?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:819
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_0da95cfe:

    # MC "Whatever it is, let's go get some sleep."
    MC "뭐든 간에, 가서 잠 좀 자자."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:836
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6d3b7e65:

    # "In the dead of night, I was restless."
    "한밤중, 나는 잠들지 못하고 뒤척였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:841
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8c266e01:

    # "Opening my eyes, I sat-upright in my bunk and looked around."
    "눈을 뜨고 침상에 똑바로 앉아 주위를 둘러보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:843
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccd5a8ea:

    # "Everyone around me was deep in sleep still, including Markus."
    "마르쿠스를 포함해 내 주위의 모두가 여전히 깊은 잠에 빠져 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:844
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_03bec688:

    # "I sighed, rubbing my forehead as I climbed out of bed."
    "한숨을 쉬며 이마를 문지르며 침대에서 일어났다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:845
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b9564fe7:

    # "{i}Just a short walk around the fort grounds{/i} I told myself..."
    "{i}그냥 요새 부지를 잠깐 산책이나 하자{/i} 라고 나는 스스로에게 말했다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:846
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af74cbd2:

    # "I'll be back before anyone even realizes I'm gone."
    "아무도 내가 사라진 걸 눈치채기도 전에 돌아올 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:853
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59eaf8b8:

    # "As the cold night air hit my lungs, I thought about heading back inside before I heard Captain Duprey's voice."
    "차가운 밤공기가 폐를 찌르자, 나는 안으로 돌아갈까 생각하다가 뒤프레 대위의 목소리를 들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:854
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4acebe14:

    # DUPREY "Thank you all for coming..."
    DUPREY "모두 와줘서 고맙소..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:855
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_14ad4098:

    # MC "(Hm? What's going on?)"
    MC "(음? 무슨 일이지?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:856
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b6dd5166:

    # MC "(It sounds like it's coming from the training yard.)"
    MC "(훈련장 쪽에서 들리는 것 같아.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:867
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f159a15b:

    # "Peering around the corner, Captain Duprey stood alongside Borras as two figures joined them."
    "모퉁이 너머를 살짝 들여다보니, 뒤프레 대위가 보라스와 함께 서 있었고, 두 인물이 그들 곁에 합류했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:870
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_683fa502:

    # "The first, a beautiful, yet stern and cold looking blonde in a hooded robe."
    "첫 번째는 후드 달린 로브를 입은, 아름답지만 엄하고 냉랭한 인상의 금발 여성이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:871
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_39c09853:

    # "The other, a man of larger stature who I had not seen either."
    "다른 한 명은 내가 본 적 없는, 더 큰 체구의 남자였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:873
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c3816f8a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Well, out with it."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "뭐야, 말해봐."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:874
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_829708c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Why did you ask us to meet here and not in my office?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "왜 우리를 내 사무실이 아니라 여기서 만나자고 한 거지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:875
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e5dab11:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "I'm freezing my tits off out here you know."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "여기서 내 가슴이 얼어붙겠어, 알지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:876
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5d90ff9:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "I could keep them warm for you if you wish."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "원한다면 내가 따뜻하게 해줄 수 있는데."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:878
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8cce2042:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Lay a hand on me and you will never {i}touch{/i} anything again."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "나한테 손대면, 다시는 아무것도 {i}만지지{/i} 못하게 될 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:879
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccb33939:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Feisty as always."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "여전히 당돌하군."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:880
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7d3baf97:

    # DUPREY "I'm sorry for summoning you both at such a late hour."
    DUPREY "이렇게 늦은 시간에 둘을 소환해서 미안하오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:881
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_438696b5:

    # DUPREY "I couldn't risk the potential of spies listening in on what I had to say now."
    DUPREY "내가 지금 할 말을 염탐꾼들이 들을 위험을 감수할 수 없었소."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:882
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_15a278d5:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "And out here is safer than my office how?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "그리고 여기가 내 사무실보다 안전하다는 게 어떻게?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:883
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ea753ae:

    # DUPREY "{i}*Sigh*{/i} I recently conducted a private search across the whole fortress with only my most trusted men."
    DUPREY "{i}*한숨*{/i} 최근에 내 가장 신뢰하는 부하들만 데리고 요새 전체를 비공식 수색했소."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:884
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_627d96fc:

    # DUPREY "I found echo crystals everywhere... including your office."
    DUPREY "곳곳에서 메아리 수정을 발견했소... 당신 사무실을 포함해서."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:885
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e306341:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You..."
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "당신이..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:886
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2b146927:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Echo crystals?{/i}"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}메아리 수정이라고?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:887
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7cc2c81:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "That can't be right, I have my office checked, I-"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "그럴 리 없어, 내 사무실은 정기적으로 검사해, 나는—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:888
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7233b5ac:

    # "Duprey nodded, holding up a small, glowing yellow crystal that he tossed to the robed blonde."
    "뒤프레가 고개를 끄덕이며, 작고 빛나는 노란 수정을 들어 올려 로브를 입은 금발에게 던졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:890
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b21cd245:

    # DUPREY "I'm afraid it's so."
    DUPREY "유감이지만 사실이오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:891
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3e335085:

    # "The woman inspected the crystal and gritted her teeth in anger at it."
    "여자는 수정을 살펴보더니 분노로 이를 갈았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:892
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1faccc03:

    # DUPREY "It seems our great {i}'emperor'{/i} does not hold our loyalty in high regard."
    DUPREY "보니 우리의 위대한 '황제'께서 우리의 충성을 그리 높이 사지 않으시는 모양이오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:893
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d6956b86:

    # "The larger man chuckled."
    "덩치 큰 남자가 킬킬 웃었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:894
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cac71787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "After everything that's happened, can you truly blame him?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "지금껏 일어난 모든 일을 생각하면, 진심으로 그를 탓할 수 있겠나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:895
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e7113e66:

    # "The blonde woman seemed more frustrated than the others, coiling her one hand into a tight fist."
    "금발 여자는 다른 이들보다 더 좌절한 듯, 한 손을 꽉 쥐어 주먹을 만들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:896
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_897edc9c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Come now, this is all part of the game."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "자자, 이 모든 게 게임의 일부일세."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:897
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_da595d25:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Yes, I... I am aware."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "그래, 나... 알고 있어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:898
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_aed55156:

    # DUPREY "The guards only patrol this area periodically, and it's the one place no echo crystals turned up during the search."
    DUPREY "경비병들은 이 구역을 주기적으로만 순찰하오, 그리고 수색 중에 메아리 수정이 하나도 발견되지 않은 유일한 장소이기도 하오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:899
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cf9fe043:

    # DUPREY "I suppose they figured the chatter of grunts wasn't worth hearing."
    DUPREY "놈들은 졸병들의 잡담은 들을 가치가 없다고 생각했나 보오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:900
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4b3ecc3c:

    # DUPREY "Which is exactly why we're meeting here now."
    DUPREY "바로 그게 우리가 지금 여기서 만나는 이유요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:901
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97cd58fc:

    # "The larger man raised his brow."
    "덩치 큰 남자가 눈썹을 치켜올렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:902
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c4efb787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "That's all well and good... But why exactly is {i}he{/i} here?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "그건 다 좋은데... 도대체 왜 {i}그가{/i} 여기 있는 거지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:903
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ecda2cd:

    # "The man pointed towards Borras, whose brow furrowed at the comment."
    "남자는 보라스를 가리켰고, 그 말에 보라스의 눈썹이 찌푸려졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:904
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a377fbed:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "He's hardly fit to stand here with the rest of us."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "그는 우리와 함께 여기 설 자격이 거의 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:905
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_000b3a6c:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras will be replacing me for command of the Second Scouts Division, within a year or so."
    DUPREY "보라스 장교가 1년 안에 나를 대신해 제2정찰대 사단을 지휘하게 될 거요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:906
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ade1214e:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You're leaving?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "떠난다고?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:907
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2897e861:

    # DUPREY "My time is nearly up... I'm slowing down too much."
    DUPREY "내 시간이 거의 다 됐소... 너무 느려지고 있소."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:908
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1d99c218:

    # "While the blonde seemed saddened to hear this, the larger man opened his palm upwards towards the sky."
    "금발은 이 말을 듣고 슬퍼 보였지만, 덩치 큰 남자는 손바닥을 하늘로 향해 펼쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:909
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c246e162:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I hope you didn't drag us out here to discuss your future retirement plans you old fuck."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "우릴 여기까지 끌고 와서 네 은퇴 계획이나 논하자는 건 아니길 바라네, 이 늙은 망할 놈아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:910
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dd633049:

    # DUPREY "Hmph..."
    DUPREY "흠..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:911
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_07d9c1a1:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras, hand them the reports."
    DUPREY "보라스 장교, 그들에게 보고서를 건네주게."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:912
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_85fc15c1:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Yes Captain."
    BORRAS @ talk "알겠습니다, 대위님."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:914
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a550ea4e:

    # "Borras handed over a few sheets of paper towards the robed pair."
    "보라스는 로브를 입은 두 사람에게 몇 장의 종이를 건넸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:915
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e077ed9f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "What's this?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "이게 뭐지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:916
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbb0024b:

    # DUPREY "A report that Alcott attempted to suppress."
    DUPREY "알콧이 은폐하려고 했던 보고서요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:917
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0873ff5f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "About?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "무슨 내용?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:918
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dfb5dc62:

    # DUPREY "...{i}Zanarak has returned.{/i}"
    DUPREY "...{i}자나락이 돌아왔소.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:919
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dbf78d30:

    # "A great unease filled the air and I felt a shiver tingle it's way up my spine."
    "커다란 불안감이 공기를 가득 채웠고, 나는 전율이 척추를 타고 올라오는 것을 느꼈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:920
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_506be64d:

    # "The name crawled and dragged its way horribly across my thoughts."
    "그 이름이 내 생각 속을 끔찍하게 기어 다니며 파고들었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:921
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_04766be0:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "There hasn't been a sighting in years."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "수년간 목격된 적이 없었는데."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:922
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ad6d35ce:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Wasn't it reported that the beast was hunted down by the Inquisition?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "그 야수가 종교재판소에게 사냥당했다고 보고되지 않았나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:923
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbbee22b:

    # DUPREY "A lie told to ease panicking nobles."
    DUPREY "공포에 질린 귀족들을 달래기 위해 지어낸 거짓말이오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:924
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_38a43a2d:

    # DUPREY "While it is true the beast has vanished for the last few years, this cannot be ignored."
    DUPREY "지난 몇 년간 그 야수가 사라진 것은 사실이지만, 이것을 무시할 순 없소."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:925
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_78892759:

    # DUPREY "The beast's return... changes things."
    DUPREY "야수의 귀환은... 상황을 바꾸오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:926
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7a86413b:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "A specter, a boogeyman..."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "유령, 부기맨..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:927
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a777b442:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "There are dozens of Demorai over the years that people have wrongly mistaken for being Zanarak."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "수년 동안 사람들이 자나락으로 잘못 착각한 데모라이만 수십 마리야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:928
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_086782c0:

    # "The man belligerently crossed his arms."
    "남자는 적대적으로 팔짱을 꼈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:929
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ee8e9a7d:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...I'm not even convinced this Zanarak was real to begin with."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...난 애초에 이 자나락이 진짜였는지조차 확신이 안 서."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:930
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ebb0762:

    # DUPREY "Oh... He's as real as you and I alright."
    DUPREY "오... 그자는 당신이나 나만큼이나 확실히 진짜요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:931
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ba99ad23:

    # DUPREY "Make no mistake about that."
    DUPREY "그 점은 착각하지 마시오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:932
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6b72d9c8:

    # DUPREY "...And when he comes, all of us need to be prepared."
    DUPREY "...그리고 그가 오면, 우리 모두 준비되어 있어야 하오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:933
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2bce0fc0:

    # DUPREY "With, {i}or without{/i} the Emperors knowledge."
    DUPREY "황제가 알든 {i}모르든{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:934
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3cdbebf1:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "What are you saying, Duprey?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "무슨 말을 하는 거지, 뒤프레?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:935
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59e5864b:

    # DUPREY "I'm saying, Alcott can bury his head in the fucking sand and play politics all he wants to try and appease wet-fart nobles."
    DUPREY "내 말은, 알콧은 씨발 모래 속에 머리를 처박고, 방귀쟁이 귀족들을 달래려고 정치질이나 하면 된다는 거요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:936
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_fcc3f2c9:

    # DUPREY "{i}But we need to be prepared for what's to come whether this knowledge is made public or not.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}하지만 우리는 이 정보가 공개되든 말든 다가올 일에 대비해야 하오.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:937
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_18e7a24a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Duprey... You need to tread carefully with this."
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "뒤프레... 이 건은 신중하게 다뤄야 해."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:938
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_5b839082:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "How exactly did {i}you{/i} manage to get your hands on this report anyway?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "도대체 {i}당신이{/i} 어떻게 이 보고서를 손에 넣은 거지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:939
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a2aca459:

    # BORRAS @ talk "By pure chance."
    BORRAS @ talk "순전한 우연이었습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:940
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a174e1ce:

    # "Borras stepped forward."
    "보라스가 앞으로 나섰다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:941
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_913c0dc3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "I was on a normal patrol through the Valley of Death when I stumbled upon a small, slaughtered convoy."
    BORRAS @ talk "죽음의 계곡에서 정규 순찰 중이었는데, 작은 호송대가 학살당한 현장을 우연히 발견했습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:942
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_787647a3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Amongst their dead was an Inquisitor, who with his dying breath handed me this report."
    BORRAS @ talk "그 시체들 사이에 종교재판관이 있었는데, 죽어가며 이 보고서를 제게 건넸습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:943
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a7d9dd7a:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "The dying words of a delusional Inquisitor on death's door mean very little."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "죽음의 문턱에서 헛소리하는 종교재판관의 유언은 아무 의미도 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:944
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_46254da9:

    # BORRAS @ talk "There was other reports..."
    BORRAS @ talk "다른 보고서들도 있었습니다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:945
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f3335e6e:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "What?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "뭐라고?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:946
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_825a1215:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Suppressed as soon as they arrive, but more and more scant reports from our men on the fringes have reported seeing it."
    BORRAS @ talk "도착하자마자 은폐되지만, 변경의 우리 병사들로부터 점점 더 많은 단편적 보고서들이 그것을 목격했다고 전해지고 있습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:947
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0d7eadc0:

    # "Both the woman and man were troubled the more they heard."
    "여자와 남자 모두 들을수록 더욱 불안해했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:948
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f2428e23:

    # DUPREY "From now on, the three of us need to work closer together."
    DUPREY "이제부터, 우리 셋은 더 긴밀히 협력해야 하오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:949
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a899d6c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "The city guard is barely holding on as it is, what exactly do you expect me to do?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "도시 경비대도 겨우 버티고 있는 판에, 내가 도대체 뭘 어쩌길 바라는 거지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:950
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b10a0545:

    # DUPREY "Whatever you have to do when the time comes."
    DUPREY "때가 되면 당신이 해야 할 일을 하시오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:951
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6afc1660:

    # "Duprey seemed to be working himself up into a feverish plea."
    "뒤프레는 열변을 토하듯 격앙되어 가고 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:952
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_104f25e1:

    # DUPREY "These little camps everyone's set up is leaving us more divided than ever, it'll be the ruin of us all!"
    DUPREY "모두가 세워놓은 이 작은 야영지들이 우릴 그 어느 때보다 분열시키고 있소, 이게 우리 모두의 파멸이 될 거요!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:953
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2e21a987:

    # DUPREY "We need to unite and pledge to each other that when the time comes-"
    DUPREY "우리는 단결해야 하고, 때가 오면 서로에게 맹세해야 하오—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:954
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59c8c819:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I promise you nothing, Duprey."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "난 아무것도 약속할 수 없네, 뒤프레."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:955
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e629b28d:

    # "The broad man's words cut through Duprey's like ice."
    "덩치 큰 남자의 말이 얼음처럼 뒤프레의 말을 잘라냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:956
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b4c2c3b7:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...But I shall look into these reports myself."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...하지만 이 보고서들을 직접 조사해보겠네."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:957
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ebf4078c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "And depending on what I find, {i}perhaps{/i} there will be more to discuss."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "그리고 내가 무엇을 발견하느냐에 따라, {i}아마도{/i} 더 논의할 게 있을 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:958
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e102cb4c:

    # "The broad man turned to leave, and as he did so, Captain Duprey looked towards the woman."
    "덩치 큰 남자가 떠나려고 몸을 돌리자, 뒤프레 대위는 여자를 바라보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:959
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6ff2487b:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "... I don't know, Duprey, this just maybe isn't the right time."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...모르겠어, 뒤프레, 아마 지금은 적절한 때가 아닐지도 몰라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:960
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ece5bef6:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "The more we unite our forces, the more we paint ourselves a target for the other factions."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "우리가 세력을 더 통합할수록, 다른 파벌들에게 더 큰 표적이 될 뿐이야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:961
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5cdc275:

    # DUPREY "... I don't care about the factions."
    DUPREY "...난 파벌 따위 상관없소."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:962
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_361df80b:

    # DUPREY "I don't care about the politics of the damn thing."
    DUPREY "그 빌어먹을 정치질도 상관없소."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:963
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_538b8cf8:

    # DUPREY "What does any of that matter if there's no one left in the end?"
    DUPREY "결국 아무도 남지 않는다면 그 모든 게 무슨 소용이란 말이오?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:964
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7e9daac:

    # DUPREY "Newheart is gone... There's no one left to save us but ourselves now."
    DUPREY "뉴하트는 사라졌소... 이제 우리를 구할 사람은 우리 자신뿐이오."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:965
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e94a49a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Goodnight, Duprey."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...잘 자요, 뒤프레."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:966
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2d5676a4:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "I hope you're wrong about all this... I really do."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "당신이 이 모든 것에 대해 틀렸길 바라요... 정말로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:967
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3bff260d:

    # "The woman turned to leave and join the broad man, leaving Captain Duprey to stand beside Officer Borras alone."
    "여자는 몸을 돌려 덩치 큰 남자와 합류했고, 뒤프레 대위는 보라스 장교와 홀로 남겨졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:971
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_9b060e61:

    # "As the two figures passed me by, I hid myself behind a barrel and waited for them to be out of sight."
    "두 인물이 나를 지나치자, 나는 통 뒤에 숨어 그들이 시야에서 사라질 때까지 기다렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:974
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d553e83d:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Captain..."
    BORRAS @ talk "대위님..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:975
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_eba06326:

    # DUPREY "Return to your quarters, Borras."
    DUPREY "네 숙소로 돌아가게, 보라스."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:976
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6fa2cda7:

    # DUPREY "Speak nothing of what has been said tonight."
    DUPREY "오늘 밤 논의된 것에 대해 아무 말도 하지 마."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:977
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f9c712a9:

    # BORRAS @ sad "But-"
    BORRAS @ sad "하지만—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:978
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_87e8ae86:

    # DUPREY "I'm tired Borras... So very tired."
    DUPREY "난 지쳤네, 보라스... 너무나 지쳤어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:979
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ae2d5a5:

    # DUPREY "The next battle can wait for another day."
    DUPREY "다음 전투는 다른 날로 미루지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:982
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a5187100:

    # "Slowly, I watched as Captain Duprey slumped towards the barracks, likely back to his quarters."
    "뒤프레 대위가 병영 쪽으로 터덜터덜 걸어가는 것을, 아마 그의 숙소로 향하는 것을 나는 천천히 지켜보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:984
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e034c8e5:

    # MC "(Zanarak... Can it really be?)"
    MC "(자나락... 정말 그럴 수 있을까?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:986
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97d93231:

    # "I shook my head, pushing the terrible thoughts away."
    "나는 고개를 저으며 그 끔찍한 생각들을 밀쳐냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:987
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d2897e6b:

    # MC "(I need to return to my bed, before someone sees me.)"
    MC "(누가 보기 전에 침상으로 돌아가야 해.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:993
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97284131:

    # "As I laid down onto the bed, dark, terrible thoughts and dreams returned."
    "침대에 누우니, 어둡고 끔찍한 생각과 꿈들이 다시 찾아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:994
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af180033:

    # "Returned to torment me for the rest of the night."
    "남은 밤 동안 나를 괴롭히기 위해 돌아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1009
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_eb24fb27:

    # DUPREY "Alright maggots, today I will see whether you lot have made any progress or had you just wasted my time!"
    DUPREY "자, 구더기들아, 오늘은 너희가 진전이 있었는지 아니면 내 시간만 낭비했는지 확인할 거다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1010
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_884243ea:

    # DUPREY "We will start with duels first!"
    DUPREY "먼저 결투부터 시작한다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1011
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_62189e19:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, grab yourself a healing vial, and fight as if your life depended on it!"
    DUPREY "짝을 짓고, 회복 물약을 챙기고, 네 목숨이 달렸다는 듯이 싸워라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1016
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_761342c6:

    # MC "Shit got real, huh?"
    MC "상황이 진짜가 됐네, 응?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1017
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_67044540:

    # "Markus was certainly not going to fool around this time."
    "마르쿠스는 이번에는 분명히 장난치지 않을 생각이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1018
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_d92306b7:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Come on, [player_name!t], let's do this!"
    MARKUS @ angry "어서, [player_name!t], 하자!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1019
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_bc95234e:

    # MC @ angry "Alright, bring it on then!"
    MC @ angry "좋아, 그럼 덤벼 봐!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1053
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_1263e952:

    # "Ouch."
    "아야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1054
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_c58b41a1:

    # "Darkness."
    "어둠."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1055
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8f6cd72d:

    # "Then, dim light telling shapes apart."
    "그리고, 형체를 겨우 구분할 수 있는 희미한 빛."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1056
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_ce93bfa4:

    # "A vision."
    "환영."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1057
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_a05d37f2:

    # "A vision of Alderay under demonic onslaught."
    "악마의 맹공격을 받는 알데레이의 환영."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1058
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_f32b1941:

    # "Of me, defending it's people."
    "그 백성을 지키는 나의 모습."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1059
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_27cd56c1:

    # "Uniting them under my banners."
    "내 깃발 아래 그들을 단결시키는 모습."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1060
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_63b84b20:

    # "Power."
    "권력."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1061
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_008f17f9:

    # "Wealth."
    "부."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1062
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d7eea514:

    # "Women..."
    "여자들..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1063
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_b6ce6190:

    # "However, there is something else."
    "하지만, 다른 무언가도 있다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1064
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8bf4ebd2:

    # "Something that drives me onwards, something from outside..."
    "나를 앞으로 나아가게 하는 무언가, 바깥에서 오는 무언가..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1065
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_90b93b6a:

    # "It's..."
    "그건..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1068
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d1df3db6:

    # "Ice-cold water!"
    "얼음처럼 차가운 물이다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1074
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_bc5c4518:

    # DUPREY "{b}ON YOUR FEET, MAGGOT!{/b}"
    DUPREY "{b}일어나, 이 구더기 놈아!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1075
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_5ad11caa:

    # "Captain Duprey's heavy kick quickly stood me up straight, recent knockout echoing in my head with an irritating, pulsing pain."
    "뒤프레 대위의 묵직한 발길질에 나는 곧바로 일어섰지만, 최근의 기절이 짜증스럽고 욱신거리는 통증으로 머릿속에 메아리쳤다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1076
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_e7a57264:

    # DUPREY "Go again, Demorai won't wait for you to come back to your senses!"
    DUPREY "다시 가라, 데모라이가 네가 정신 차릴 때까지 기다려주지 않는다!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1077
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_032e9f26:

    # MC "(Gotta get a grip...)"
    MC "(정신 차려야 해...)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1078
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_523ecf6e:

    # DUPREY @ angry "I'm trying to be nice to you maggot, now go again!"
    DUPREY @ angry "내가 친절하게 대해주는 거다, 구더기야. 다시 가라!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1090
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6a4925e0:

    # MARKUS "Gah! You sure know how to make it hurt!"
    MARKUS "윽! 넌 진짜 아프게 하는 법을 아는구나!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1091
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fb6a986:

    # MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Someone’s had to knock some sense into you!"
    MC "{i}*헉*{/i} 누군가 네게 정신 좀 차려야 했지!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1092
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_66516ca5:

    # "As me and Markus caught our breath, I noticed an unusual figure dressed in fine fabrics speaking to the Captain."
    "나와 마르쿠스가 숨을 고르는 동안, 나는 고급 천으로 된 옷을 입은 낯선 인물이 대위와 대화하는 것을 알아챘다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1093
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_163ee6d6:

    # "The Captain seemed unimpressed with whatever the man was saying and seemed to be refusing him something before being handed what seemed like a very official looking letter."
    "대위는 그 남자가 무슨 말을 하든 마음에 들지 않는 듯 보였고, 무언가를 거절하는 듯하다가 아주 공식적으로 보이는 편지를 건네받았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1094
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_783e0863:

    # "I thought I could make out the royal seal."
    "나는 왕실 인장을 알아볼 수 있을 것 같았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1095
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_edb3c6df:

    # "I couldn’t hear what was being said, but I managed to figure out the words escaping his lips, {i}‘They’re not ready yet!’{/i}"
    "무슨 말이 오가는지 들리진 않았지만, 그의 입술에서 나오는 말을 겨우 알아챌 수 있었다, {i}'그들은 아직 준비가 안 됐어!'{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1096
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7e66af39:

    # MARKUS "What’s going on?"
    MARKUS "무슨 일이야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1097
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_28993885:

    # "I nudged him to look over towards Duprey."
    "나는 그를 툭 쳐서 뒤프레 쪽을 보라고 했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1098
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_78c93499:

    # MARKUS "... Is that someone from the palace?"
    MARKUS "...저 사람 설마 궁에서 온 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1099
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6da37e5e:

    # MC "I think so."
    MC "그런 것 같아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1100
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c390d19a:

    # MARKUS "Since when did the palace send its fancy officials down to us mud and grunts?"
    MARKUS "언제부터 궁에서 그런 고급 관리를 우리 같은 진흙탕 졸병들한테 보낸 거지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1101
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d52535a2:

    # MARKUS "What do you think they want? It must be serious."
    MARKUS "뭘 원하는 걸까? 분명 심각한 일이겠지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1102
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_67965d23:

    # MC "I don’t know... but I don’t think it’s going to be anything good."
    MC "모르겠어... 하지만 좋은 일은 아닐 것 같아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1107
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_452c6b58:

    # "All of a sudden, the Captain heaved himself reluctantly onto the wooden platform and cried out for our attention."
    "갑자기 대위가 마지못해 몸을 일으켜 나무 단상 위로 올라가 우리의 주목을 요구했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1108
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4074b31d:

    # DUPREY "FORM RANKS!"
    DUPREY "대열 정렬!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1110
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7bdc104e:

    # "The tired and weary Scouts hastily moved to form neat rows and face the Captain, hanging on his every word."
    "지치고 피곤한 정찰대원들은 서둘러 단정한 열을 지어 대위를 향해 섰고, 그의 모든 말에 매달렸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1111
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d0187a8e:

    # DUPREY "We have been ordered on early leave for a mission."
    DUPREY "우리는 임무를 위해 조기 출발 명령을 받았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1112
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_af5fac36:

    # "Confused mutterings swept through the ranks, as most of us expected the training to last for months."
    "우리 대부분이 훈련이 몇 달간 지속될 거라 예상했기에, 혼란스러운 웅성거림이 대열을 휩쓸었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1113
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_41c2d6b4:

    # DUPREY "SILENCE!!!"
    DUPREY "조용!!!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1114
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_219c5f53:

    # DUPREY "This order has come down from Emperor Alcott himself and has been approved by King Mesamor."
    DUPREY "이 명령은 알콧 황제 폐하께서 직접 내리셨고, 메사모르 왕의 승인을 받았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1115
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b792546:

    # DUPREY "We leave come first light tomorrow."
    DUPREY "내일 동트는 대로 출발한다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1116
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fa47cd9:

    # DUPREY "Get to bed early, make sure you’re well fed and be absolutely certain that your equipment is clean and ready."
    DUPREY "일찍 자고, 배불리 먹고, 장비가 깨끗하고 준비되었는지 철저히 확인해라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1117
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_cae6e8d4:

    # "A timid hand was raised from the crowd."
    "군중 속에서 조심스럽게 손이 하나 올라갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1118
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c2e2d792:

    # DUPREY "What is it?"
    DUPREY "뭐냐?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1120
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_13b24539:

    # RECRUIT "Where are we to be sent, sir?"
    RECRUIT "어디로 가는 겁니까, 대위님?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1121
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_544b0d7d:

    # DUPREY "The mission is top secret, all I can tell you is that you will be recovering relics from a lost fortress south of here."
    DUPREY "임무는 일급 기밀이다. 내가 말해줄 수 있는 건, 여기서 남쪽의 잃어버린 요새에서 유물들을 회수하게 될 거란 것뿐이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1122
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac7589b:

    # DUPREY "Expect at least six weeks march, take this into consideration with your prep."
    DUPREY "최소 6주간의 행군을 예상해라. 준비할 때 이것을 고려하도록."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1123
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "이상!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1126
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cfa9b03:

    # "With that, the Captain stormed his way off stage, angrily shoving the sealed letter back into the fumbling hands of the palace official before stalking back to his quarters."
    "그러고는 대위는 성큼성큼 무대를 떠났다. 봉인된 편지를 궁 관리의 더듬거리는 손에 화를 내며 다시 쑤셔 넣고는, 자기 숙소로 성큼성큼 걸어갔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1127
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fa69c2ee:

    # "The men soon dissolved the ranks and the process of packing up for our departure began."
    "병사들은 곧 대열을 해산했고, 출발을 위한 짐 꾸리기가 시작되었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1133
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_73d9be9c:

    # "There was much confused chatter about what this {i}‘secret mission’{/i} entailed, and more so the worry of now being confronted by the Demorai so clearly unprepared."
    "이 {i}'비밀 임무'{/i}가 무엇을 수반하는지에 대한 혼란스러운 잡담이 많았고, 더욱이 명백히 준비되지 않은 채 데모라이와 맞닥뜨리게 될지도 모른다는 걱정이 더 컸다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1134
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d33077f7:

    # MARKUS "What the fuck was all that about?"
    MARKUS "방금 그거 다 뭐야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1135
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_07f11245:

    # MC "I don’t know, looks like some higher up bullshit to me."
    MC "몰라, 윗선의 헛소리 같은데."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1136
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3e0ef9c5:

    # MC "Guess we'll be skipping the test then..."
    MC "그럼 시험은 건너뛰는 건가 보네..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1137
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_52b2a82f:

    # MARKUS "Hm... I’ll make sure to pack some extra bread for you, okay?"
    MARKUS "흠... 너 줄 빵 좀 더 챙겨놓을게, 알았지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1138
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f6d7e7b6:

    # MC "Where’d you get the extra rations from, you fancy fuck?"
    MC "그 추가 식량은 어디서 났어, 이 고급진 놈아?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1139
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a1c732d3:

    # MARKUS "My brother sent it to me the other day, figured we could split it..."
    MARKUS "며칠 전에 우리 형이 보내줬어, 나눠 먹으면 되겠다 싶었지..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1140
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ce4a9c8a:

    # MC "Oh, thank you."
    MC "오, 고마워."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1141
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7ff3445a:

    # MARKUS "In return I want some of that sweet wine you got!"
    MARKUS "그 대신 네가 가진 그 달콤한 와인 좀 줘!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1142
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_95e59f81:

    # MC "What?!"
    MC "뭐?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1143
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_282b2d00:

    # MARKUS "Hey! Don’t hold out on me! I know your dear sweet [regina_ref!t] brought you some!"
    MARKUS "야! 숨기지 마! 네 사랑하는 [regina_ref!t]이(가) 가져다줬다는 거 알아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1144
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b5596df:

    # MC "Alright, alright, {i}we’ll share.{/i}"
    MC "알았어, 알았어, {i}나눠 마시자.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1145
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_31c038e0:

    # MARKUS "That’s more like it!"
    MARKUS "그거야말로 내가 듣고 싶던 말이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1146
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbd1034e:

    # MARKUS "Didn’t want to have to bust your balls the whole trip if I die of dehydration because you wouldn’t spare {i}‘a single drop’{/i} for your dearest and oldest friend!"
    MARKUS "네가 너의 가장 소중하고 오래된 친구에게 {i}'한 방울도'{/i} 아까워해서 탈수로 죽게 된다면 여행 내내 네 불알을 까는 수고를 하고 싶진 않았어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1147
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9f87cee2:

    # MC "But then how would I achieve my dream of becoming a drunk?"
    MC "하지만 그럼 내 술꾼이 되겠다는 꿈은 어떻게 이루지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1148
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_957e6607:

    # MARKUS "I have every confidence that you’ll find a way, no matter what."
    MARKUS "네가 무슨 수를 써서라도 길을 찾을 거라고 나는 확신해."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1150
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a370dbb4:

    # "Suddenly, the ginger haired girl strutted over to us, a coy little smile on her face."
    "갑자기, 생강색 머리의 소녀가 교활한 작은 미소를 얼굴에 띤 채 우리에게 다가왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1151
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d469bfc4:

    # KIARA "Looks like I’ve been partnered up with you two for the march."
    KIARA "행군에 너희 둘이랑 한 조로 배정된 것 같네."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1152
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cea643d:

    # MARKUS "Oh?"
    MARKUS "오?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1153
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5926d935:

    # KIARA @ happy "Aye, that won’t be a problem, will it?"
    KIARA @ happy "응, 문제 되지 않지, 그렇지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1154
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f3de8e53:

    # MARKUS "After that little show you put on with the Captain when we first got here? It’ll be our pleasure."
    MARKUS "우리가 처음 왔을 때 대위랑 보여준 그 작은 쇼 이후로? 영광이지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1155
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4e8676e6:

    # MARKUS "I’ll be sure to let you soften the Demorai up before I get there!"
    MARKUS "내가 도착하기 전에 네가 데모라이를 좀 상대해줄 수 있도록 확실히 할게!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1156
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0739d47d:

    # KIARA "How {i}valiant{/i} of you."
    KIARA "참 {i}용감하시네{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1158
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2cba1877:

    # "I caught her gaze and nodded:"
    "나는 그녀의 시선을 사로잡고 고개를 끄덕였다:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1159
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ae8a726e:

    # MC "Kiara."
    MC "키아라."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1160
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_107ca765:

    # "Kiara nodded and smiled mischievously."
    "키아라가 고개를 끄덕이며 짓궂게 미소 지었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1161
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_1b1ca23b:

    # KIARA "What do they call your cute friend here?"
    KIARA "여기 네 귀여운 친구는 뭐라고 부르니?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1162
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_435e4d75:

    # MARKUS "Hey! I can hear you!"
    MARKUS "야! 다 들린다고!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1163
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_217ebd58:

    # KIARA "I know, honey. So?"
    KIARA "알아, 자기야. 그래서?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1164
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_65cbbe79:

    # MARKUS "...It's Markus."
    MARKUS "...마르쿠스야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1165
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_246faf04:

    # KIARA @ happy "Well then, pleasure to meet you, Markus."
    KIARA @ happy "그럼 만나서 반가워, 마르쿠스."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1166
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0757128a:

    # KIARA "I'll take the rear, is that alright with you guys?"
    KIARA "내가 후방을 맡을게, 괜찮지?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1169
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_deaeaf6f:

    # MC "What’s your name?"
    MC "이름이 뭐야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1170
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5e61be4f:

    # KIARA "Kiara, love."
    KIARA "키아라야, 자기."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1173
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8ae7bf84:

    # "Kiara smiled and winked mischievously."
    "키아라가 미소 지으며 짓궂게 윙크했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1174
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a0467524:

    # KIARA "What do they call you cuties then?"
    KIARA "그럼 귀염둥이들, 이름이 뭐니?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1175
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f39a4545:

    # MARKUS "Oooh, did you hear that? She thinks we’re cute!"
    MARKUS "오오오, 들었어? 그녀가 우리보고 귀엽대!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1176
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_e8544c91:

    # KIARA "Not when you speak, but I’ve seen worse looking."
    KIARA "네가 말할 땐 아니야, 그래도 더 못생긴 것들도 봤어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1177
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d5d404a7:

    # KIARA "Even if you are pale as a ghost!"
    KIARA "네가 유령처럼 창백해도 말이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1178
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbeafcd2:

    # MARKUS "Hey!"
    MARKUS "야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1179
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2c7fdf17:

    # MC "I’m [player_name!t]."
    MC "난 [player_name!t]야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1180
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a74d1cac:

    # MARKUS "Markus."
    MARKUS "마르쿠스."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1181
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_e4d4b219:

    # MARKUS @ angry "And I ain’t no ghost!"
    MARKUS @ angry "그리고 난 유령이 아니라고!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1182
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_36300c92:

    # KIARA "Pleasure to meet you both, I’ll take the rear?"
    KIARA "둘 다 만나서 반가워, 내가 후방을 맡아도 될까?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1184
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_35e56202:

    # MC "I don’t see why not."
    MC "안 될 이유가 없지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1185
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f81a48ca:

    # KIARA "Thanks, makes a change from you always looking at {i}my{/i} rear."
    KIARA "고마워, 네가 항상 {i}내{/i} 후방만 쳐다보는 것과는 다른 기분이네."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1186
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2accebc1:

    # MARKUS "Ha! She’s caught you out good!"
    MARKUS "하! 딱 걸렸구만!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1187
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4fc8cb2c:

    # MC "I didn’t—"
    MC "난 그런 적—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1188
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f0011b14:

    # KIARA "I didn’t say I was complaining!"
    KIARA "불평하는 거 아니라고 했잖아!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1189
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3b86159d:

    # KIARA "You can keep admiring all you like, you’re only human after all."
    KIARA "계속 감상해도 돼, 어차피 너도 인간일 뿐이잖아."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1190
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2a91684c:

    # "Markus grinned at me and laughed to himself as he saw how flustered I became."
    "마르쿠스는 내가 얼마나 당황했는지 보며 나를 보고 혼자 웃었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1191
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_42417170:

    # MC "... Hold on, how come you’ve been told to march with us?"
    MC "...잠깐, 어떻게 너한테 우리랑 같이 행군하라는 명령이 내려진 거야?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1192
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_915dc432:

    # MC "I thought you were going to be further back down the line."
    MC "넌 더 뒤쪽에 배치될 줄 알았는데."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1193
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_65264838:

    # KIARA "I might have asked the commander to move me up next to you two..."
    KIARA "아마 내가 지휘관님한테 너희 둘 옆으로 옮겨 달라고 부탁했을지도..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1194
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5a08631f:

    # MC "Why?"
    MC "왜?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1195
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3f37e306:

    # MARKUS "Obviously because of my dazzling good looks, [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "당연히 내 눈부신 미모 때문이지, [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1196
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_64e215fb:

    # KIARA "Keep lying to yourself if that’s what gets you through the day, love."
    KIARA "그게 네 하루를 버티게 해준다면 계속 그렇게 믿어, 자기야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1197
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3b54ef92:

    # KIARA "The truth is... everyone’s seen you two fighting."
    KIARA "사실은... 모두가 너희 둘 싸우는 걸 봤어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1198
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac30842:

    # KIARA "You boys make a good team."
    KIARA "너희 둘은 좋은 팀이야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1199
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_699eea4a:

    # KIARA "Better than most of this lot at least."
    KIARA "적어도 이 무리의 대부분보다는 훨씬 낫지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1200
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_673d1764:

    # KIARA "... Figured I’d stand a better chance of survival being partnered up with you two."
    KIARA "...너희 둘이랑 한 조가 되면 생존 확률이 더 높을 것 같았어."

